# SQLPage is stateless with respect to secrets — it requires no credentials of its own.
# Access is controlled by the Traefik basic-auth gate declared in metadata.yaml
# (basic_auth: true) — the customer's server password is applied there, not here.
#
# SQLPage serves SQL files from /var/www/site (mounted from /opt/sqlpage/data on the
# host) and defaults to an embedded SQLite database at /var/www/site/sqlpage.db — no
# external database is required. To connect to an external database instead, add a
# DATABASE_URL= line here with the appropriate connection string, e.g.:
#   DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/dbname
